  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十一（后）\n6:03 P.M. \\ Overcast \\ Visibility: 19 km\nDesert by Lungmen \\ Facility #14"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...I've reached the destination."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "No other abnormalities found."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Report complete."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Frostleaf, why were you frowning the whole way here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "I'm just a little concerned about Amiya's group."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "They've already safely returned to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Nearl and Dobermann already left Lungmen a week ago for their next assignment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "It must be a pretty tough mission if it required sending those two together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Blacksteel and Penguin Logistics both have their own matters to attend to."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Oh, Liskarm and Franka..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "I'm... I'm glad that they're safe..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "You've got to work hard as well, just like them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "When Franka sent you over to me, she spoke very highly of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "R-really...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "If only you weren't so timid, she said."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Uuu...."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...Hey, don't act like you're about to start crying!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Aren't you also a member of Blacksteel...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "I, I'm not... crying..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "...In any case, let's continue our mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Our next task is to work with the other recon teams to scout out this entire city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Other than searching for survivors, we also need to assess the situation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "If we encounter hostile Infected, we'll have to deal with the threat quickly."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "Even though our mission isn't particularly dangerous, it's still best to proceed with caution."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "In the event that Reunion is involved in this, we'll retreat immediately and report back to Dr. Kal'tsit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Jessica",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "Mmhm, mmhm!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frostleaf",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Meteorite",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "All that's left for us to do... is to focus on our job."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "6:12 P.M. \\ Overcast \\ Visibility: 19 km\nRhodes Island\nDeserted Nomadic City - 2 days after the discovery of 'Facility #14'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Ah... You made it, Doctor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "Good timing, Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Our job here is about done. You probably won't see us for a while~"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Are you leaving already?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "...Got it.",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "I'll miss you.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Liskarm",
          "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
          "text": "We'll see you soon enough."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Franka",
          "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "It won't be long before we're back on standby in Rhodes Island."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Franka",
          "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "Don't miss me too much."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Exusiai",
          "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
          "text": "Well, unfortunately, we don't have such an official-sounding reason. Right, Texas?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Texas",
          "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
          "text": "Hold on a second..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Exusiai",
          "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
          "text": "Penguin Logistics... is about to go on vacation!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Exusiai",
          "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
          "text": "It's only going to one precious day... But still--"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Texas",
          "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
          "text": "...Apologies. This isn't the best time to talk about it."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Don't worry... Everyone needs to get some rest."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Texas",
          "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
          "text": "...I should be the one saying that to you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Huh...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Exusiai",
          "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
          "text": "That's right, that's right. Amiya, girl, you really need a bit of R&R!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "There are many things in Rhodes Island that must be taken care of..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Liskarm",
          "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
          "text": "I can understand that, but make sure not to give yourself too much pressure, Amiya."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Franka",
          "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "No matter how strong your will is, your body won't be able to keep up if you get exhausted."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Franka",
          "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "You'd better not get sick. Everyone's counting on you!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I... Everyone has always been looking after me."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Texas",
          "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
          "text": "We were also inspired by the way you fight."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Texas",
          "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
          "text": "Just that much is enough."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Exusiai",
          "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
          "text": "Since I'm already here, I'll take this opportunity to get a free check-up before heading back."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Franka",
          "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "Our work here is about done anyway. Next up is..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Franka",
          "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "Amiya, Dr. {@nickname}."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I'm listening."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Franka & Exusiai",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Franka & Exusiai",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Keep up the good work~! Cheer up!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Wha... huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Liskarm",
          "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
          "text": "After we finish our report, we'll be right back."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Texas",
          "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
          "text": "No matter what, life must move forward."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Texas",
          "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
          "text": "Amiya, take care."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Everyone... I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...I will. You all take care as well."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "See you next time."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor,"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I have to visit the slums in outer Lungmen again. I should be of assistance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Will you be fine by yourself?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Isn't that a bit dangerous...?",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Amiya, should I go with you?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Don't worry, Doctor."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Another member of Rhodes Island, Projekt Red, will be joining me in Lungmen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "She's really good!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "With her there, you don't have to worry about me."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
